Tools/Playtest/Inbox/
Tools/Playtest/Work/
Tools/Playtest/Results/

# Discord webhooks for the playtest server (Docs/PlaytestDiscord.md): secrets, never committed.
AgentScripts/discord.local.json

# Asset Store packs (2026-11-26): kept in Unity Version Control (Plastic), not in git. They were bought, are big (about 10 GB),
# and have been changed in places (converted materials, import settings): restore them from Plastic, not from the Asset Store.
# A git clone alone is not a complete project. Each folder and its .meta go together: a .meta without its folder is deleted by Unity.
/Assets/SeedMesh/
/Assets/SeedMesh.meta
/Assets/StylizedCharacter/
/Assets/StylizedCharacter.meta
/Assets/VIVID_Arts/
/Assets/VIVID_Arts.meta
/Assets/Kevin Iglesias/
/Assets/Kevin Iglesias.meta
